# @name getStorageSpace
### Get Storage Space by ID
GET {{apiUrl}}/storage-spaces/{{storageSpaceId}}
Accept: application/ld+json
# Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}} — disabled for now, no auth implemented yet

> {%
    client.test("Status code is 200 OK", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 200, "Expected 200 OK");
    });
%}

###

# @name getStorageSpaceNotFound
### Get Storage Space - Unknown ID (expect 404)
GET {{apiUrl}}/storage-spaces/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/ld+json

> {%
    client.test("Status code is 404 Not Found", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 404, "Expected 404 Not Found");
    });
%}

